#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:3
#: 272cddca636f4d5f84fde6784248f944
msgid "随机占位（Random Occupancy）"
msgstr "Random Occupancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:5
#: 2e9b32804264421b95a5a72ac07baf61
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "**Category:** Alloys and Composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:7
#: a3e1978bf5134239b0f2e5849511ee91
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:9
#: bb412c68aca24a3395d53cb819700568
msgid ""
"这张卡把目标比例落实为实际原子占位。目标组成只能来自二者之一：`Auto (Comp tag)` 严格读取输入 `Config_type` "
"中最后一个 `Comp(...)` 标签；`Manual` 严格读取界面的“元素 / "
"目标比例”表格。所选来源缺少有效组成时会报错，不会退回另一来源。"
msgstr ""
"Convert a target fraction into actual atomic occupancy. The target "
"composition comes from exactly one of two sources: `Auto (Comp tag)` "
"strictly reads the last `Comp(...)` label in the input `Config_type`, "
"while `Manual` strictly reads the `Element / Target fraction` table in "
"the interface. If the selected source lacks a valid composition, the "
"operation reports an error and does not fall back to the other source."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:11
#: f488d7f4dfcc4be2aa6b0fb74e282487
#
msgid "它适合接在 `成分空间采样` 后把组成计划变成真实结构，也可对手工组成生成多个随机占位样本。若只想替换某一种现有元素，应使用 `随机掺杂`。"
msgstr ""
"Use it after `Composition Space Sampling` to turn composition plans into "
"real structures, or to generate several random occupancy samples for a "
"manually specified composition. Use `Random Doping` when only one "
"existing element should be replaced."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:13
#: 7678b42f2961471c8622c699f07ce177
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:15
#: 63d3e6311e7f4ea893c0a34471f6f205
msgid "设目标位点数为 $N$，归一化目标比例为 $p_e$。`Exact` 使用最大余数法得到固定的最近可行整数计数："
msgstr ""
"Let $N$ be the number of target sites and $p_e$ the normalized target "
"fraction. `Exact` uses the largest-remainder method to obtain one fixed "
"nearest-feasible integer count:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:17
#: c7f2a82d874d42f3a70935425b7262ce
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"n_e^{(0)}=\\lfloor Np_e\\rfloor,\\qquad\n"
"\\sum_e n_e=N,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:22
#: 97dc2de40c1e4bb8b6edbb666b2b9119
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"不足的位点按余数 $Np_e-n_e^{(0)}$ "
"从大到小补齐。若多个元素的余数相同，连续比例本身不能唯一决定多出的位点给谁，因此应以界面预览和输出 metadata "
"中的实际整数计数为准。`Random` 则对每个样本独立抽取"
msgstr ""
"Unassigned sites are filled in descending order of the remainders $Np_e-"
"n_e^{(0)}$. If several elements have equal remainders, the continuous "
"fractions alone do not uniquely determine which receives the extra site. "
"Use the preview and realized integer counts in output metadata as "
"authoritative. `Random` instead independently draws for every sample"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:24
#: 8d2711757f094ff597c40e27eab3ea32
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf n\\sim\\operatorname{Multinomial}(N,\\mathbf p).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:28
#: b82d2ca497d549d7bb2e6f5972f075f0
msgid ""
"两种模式都会随机打乱元素在目标位点上的位置。`Exact` 的每个样本具有相同整数计数，但该计数不一定与连续目标比例完全相等；`Random` "
"的计数会在样本间波动，只在统计平均上接近目标比例。"
msgstr ""
"Both modes randomly shuffle species across the target sites. Every "
"`Exact` sample has the same integer counts, although those counts may not"
" exactly match the continuous target fractions. `Random` counts vary "
"between samples and approach the target only in a statistical average."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:30
#: 42b3f00ecb804ba7b2a8edccb1b42f7a
msgid ""
"填写 `group_filter` 时，$N$ 只计算 `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` "
"中命中标签的位点，其他位点的元素保持不变。每个输入严格生成 `samples` 个输出，因此"
msgstr ""
"When `group_filter` is provided, $N$ counts only sites whose labels match"
" in `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`; species on all other sites remain "
"unchanged. Each input produces exactly `samples` outputs, so"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:32
#: fa3d970f5fd04179aafdc151478d3bd8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_\\mathrm{out}=N_\\mathrm{input}\\times \\mathrm{samples}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:36
#: c4a8991e05f14e74aa73532974dd40ed
msgid "不同样本可能得到相同计数甚至相同排布；卡片不去重，也不声称直接控制短程有序参数。"
msgstr ""
"Different samples may have identical counts or even identical "
"arrangements. The card does not deduplicate and does not claim to "
"directly control short-range-order parameters."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:38
#: 2cd5a329a518468b9285436bd641c4d9
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:40
#: 01d3141c48d9450cb3d86a80623c86a5
msgid "同一组成缺少占位多样性"
msgstr "Insufficient Occupancy Diversity at One Composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:42
#: a455f902ce7e473a9dcff31bd18a10d4
msgid ""
"如果训练集中每种组成只有一种占位，模型可能没有见过同一整数计数下的其他局域化学环境。可在带 "
"`Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3334)` 标签的结构后添加本卡，选择 `Exact` 并把 `samples` "
"设为 5。"
msgstr ""
"If a training set has only one occupancy arrangement for each "
"composition, the model may not have encountered other local chemical "
"environments at the same integer counts. Add this card after a structure "
"labeled `Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3334)`, select `Exact`, and set "
"`samples` to 5."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:44
#: d6706f41a3f84c52b891634cd0c5397c
msgid ""
"每个输入会得到 5 个随机占位样本，整数计数相同但排布允许重复。验证时先检查 `random_occupancy` metadata 中的 "
"`actual_counts` 与 `eligible_sites`，再按实际组成比较不同排布上的留出误差；若唯一排布数很小，应减少 "
"`samples`，而不是把重复输出当成新覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"Each input receives five random occupancy samples with identical integer "
"counts, but repeated arrangements are allowed. During validation, first "
"inspect `actual_counts` and `eligible_sites` in the `random_occupancy` "
"metadata, then compare holdout errors across arrangements at the realized"
" composition. If few unique arrangements exist, reduce `samples` instead "
"of treating duplicate outputs as new coverage."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:46
#: bbe8a713b05a494f805bf3b7b221af5d
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:48
#: d37eca00abcb4b4a995a7bc9a92b263c
msgid "来源（source）"
msgstr "source"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:50
#: 50b070e580c246109f816d5401357f5d
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Auto (Comp tag)`。可选值为 `Auto (Comp tag)` 和 `Manual`。Auto 严格读取 "
"`Config_type` 中最后一个有效 `Comp(...)`；Manual 严格读取下面的表格，两者不会互相回退。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Auto (Comp tag)`. Available values are `Auto (Comp tag)` "
"and `Manual`. Auto strictly reads the last valid `Comp(...)` in "
"`Config_type`; Manual strictly reads the table below. Neither falls back "
"to the other."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:52
#: fdf48b102bcd4f8fb7630e739b3b1478
msgid "手动（manual）"
msgstr "manual"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:54
#: 83f959e7e5204b1bbd71908bafffb55f
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。仅在 `source=Manual` 时显示“元素 / 目标比例”表格；序列化为 "
"`Co:0.333,Cr:0.333,Ni:0.334`。比例是无量纲非负权重，运行时会自动归一化，至少需要一个正值。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. The `Element / Target fraction` table appears "
"only when `source=Manual` and is serialized as "
"`Co:0.333,Cr:0.333,Ni:0.334`. Fractions are dimensionless nonnegative "
"weights, normalized automatically at runtime, with at least one positive "
"value required."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:56
#: 8e5e846b69e142b3b98f5da8e79c323c
msgid "模式（mode）"
msgstr "mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:58
#: 4caf76d9dd3f4fbeb6dad665d56a2351
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Exact`。`Exact` 为每个样本使用同一组最近可行整数计数；`Random` "
"为每个样本从多项分布重新抽取计数。两种模式都会随机分配具体位置。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Exact`. `Exact` uses the same nearest-feasible integer "
"counts for every sample; `Random` redraws counts from a multinomial "
"distribution for each sample. Both modes assign concrete sites randomly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:60
#: f49ddb235b2c488ba54ed85caa2b02f9
msgid "样本数（samples）"
msgstr "samples"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:62
#: 41ee84e163ec4ca9961242e4c323ebbf
msgid "`int`，默认 1，单位为“个结构/输入”。输出数量严格等于输入帧数乘以该值，但输出之间不保证唯一。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1, measured in structures per input. The output count is "
"exactly the input-frame count multiplied by this value, but outputs are "
"not guaranteed to be unique."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:64
#: c183d20bd3744f4fb64e6afd3b1b34f8
msgid "分组筛选（group_filter）"
msgstr "group_filter"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:66
#: 909a931faab64faa8ac2b480bbcf68e4
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。逗号分隔的 group 标签，如 `A,B`。留空表示全部位点；非空时只改变命中标签的局部目标集合。输入必须带 "
"`atoms.arrays['group']` 且至少有一个标签命中，否则显式失败。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. Comma-separated group labels such as `A,B`. "
"Empty means all sites; a nonempty value changes only the local target set"
" matching those labels. The input must contain `atoms.arrays['group']` "
"with at least one matching label, otherwise the operation fails "
"explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:68
#: aa4e68a7b31544dc8c363e9de4917bf5
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:70
#: 420ffe182cf940eb9f1233e2e4cf01a1
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。开启后，程序由基础 seed、输入 `Config_type` 的稳定 ID 和样本序号派生随机种子。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false. When enabled, the program derives the random seed "
"from the base seed, a stable ID of the input `Config_type`, and the "
"sample index."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:72
#: 1dd24fa6b94d4968901431fd5f5625b0
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:74
#: a0612775867a414d9f9de46b199fdb2d
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0，无单位，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。相同输入参数、`Config_type` 和 seed "
"可复现；数据集中的帧顺序不参与派生。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 0, dimensionless and used only when `use_seed=true`. "
"Results are reproducible for identical input parameters, `Config_type`, "
"and seed. Dataset frame order is not part of the derivation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:76
#: 6f0e7ba605f54805ac8a29d199a46d4e
msgid "推荐配置"
msgstr "Recommended Configuration"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:78
#: 970539245cc648ceb9a1970d1826ba5d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomOccupancyCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"source\": \"Auto (Comp tag)\",\n"
"    \"manual\": \"\",\n"
"    \"mode\": \"Exact\",\n"
"    \"samples\": 5,\n"
"    \"group_filter\": \"\",\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:94
#: e61e637074bf4d6ba06e17a0db59cad0
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:96
#: 967df23e5f1a4939a77f7d3b99c4d4a0
msgid "`成分空间采样` → `随机占位`：标准合金 pipeline，配比 → 落位。"
msgstr "`Composition Space Sampling` → `Random Occupancy`: the standard alloy pipeline, from target composition to explicit site occupations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:97
#: 0c0326860e0c45cf81194ca1b06b1b60
#
msgid "`原子层分组` → `随机占位`：先按原子层写入 group 标签，再限制占位区域。"
msgstr ""
"`Layer Groups` → `Random Occupancy`: assign group labels by atomic layer "
"first, then restrict the occupancy region."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:99
#: a7ebb6a055934634a789aaf3592adb11
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:101
#: acb78de17da44cdc9a3fdf2bb3f874f3
msgid ""
"**提示缺少目标成分。** Auto 模式下检查上游是否有有效 `Comp(...)`；Manual "
"模式下检查表格是否至少含一个正权重。卡片不会静默使用另一来源。"
msgstr ""
"**The card reports a missing target composition.** In Auto mode, check "
"that an upstream operation provided a valid `Comp(...)`. In Manual mode, "
"check that the table contains at least one positive weight. The card "
"never silently uses the other source."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:103
#: de34d9728f7242fc92d383d1c712a750
msgid ""
"**实际比例与 Comp 标签不完全相等。** 有限位点需要整数计数。Exact 返回最近可行计数；Random 还包含多项抽样波动。应以输出 "
"chemical symbols 和 metadata 的 `actual_counts` 为准。"
msgstr ""
"**The realized fraction does not exactly match the Comp label.** A finite"
" set of sites requires integer counts. Exact returns the nearest feasible"
" counts, while Random also includes multinomial sampling fluctuations. "
"Use output chemical symbols and metadata `actual_counts` as "
"authoritative."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:105
#: 23c045ea8a2f4ed8b75a342bbda0203e
msgid "**多个输出完全相同。** 样本是独立随机抽取，不做唯一性筛选；位点少或组成偏斜时重复概率更高。"
msgstr ""
"**Several outputs are identical.** Samples are drawn independently "
"without uniqueness filtering. Repetition is more likely with few sites or"
" a highly skewed composition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:107
#: 8368fb8de8da4a058d7252ff28a7cd7c
msgid ""
"**group_filter 报错。** 检查输入是否有与原子数等长的 "
"`atoms.arrays['group']`，且至少一个标签命中。空结构、空标签项、缺少数组和零命中均会显式失败。"
msgstr ""
"**group_filter reports an error.** Check that the input has an "
"`atoms.arrays['group']` array matching the atom count and that at least "
"one label matches. Empty structures, empty label entries, missing arrays,"
" and zero matches all fail explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:109
#: 1b495b558cc94f46bcca79d0553d4821
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:111
#: 84e6e0800daa4f08806706fc4e1e4193
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 追加 `Occ(E)` / `Occ(R)`；使用固定种子时写为 `Occ(E,s=...)` / "
"`Occ(R,s=...)`。E 和 R 只表示计数模式，不表示排布唯一。"
msgstr ""
"`Occ(E)` / `Occ(R)` is appended to `Config_type`; with fixed seeding it "
"becomes `Occ(E,s=...)` / `Occ(R,s=...)`. E and R indicate only the count "
"mode, not arrangement uniqueness."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:113
#: 3b4e189574b5497c82e6b4f621ec5404
msgid ""
"`atoms.info[\"random_occupancy\"]` 是 JSON 字符串，包含目标组成 `target`、实际 "
"`actual_counts` / `actual_fractions`、目标位点数 `eligible_sites`、分组 "
"`groups`、模式 `mode`、样本序号 `sample_index` 和实际派生 `seed`。实际化学组成以输出结构的 chemical"
" symbols 与这些字段为准；原 `Comp(...)` 仍表示请求目标。"
msgstr ""
"`atoms.info[\"random_occupancy\"]` is a JSON string containing target "
"composition `target`, realized `actual_counts` / `actual_fractions`, "
"target-site count `eligible_sites`, groups `groups`, mode `mode`, sample "
"index `sample_index`, and the actual derived `seed`. The output "
"structure's chemical symbols and these fields define the realized "
"chemical composition; the original `Comp(...)` continues to represent the"
" requested target."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:115
#: 1ae685e23da948cfa23a780a6289c087
msgid "未知元素、负数或非有限权重、非法模式、非正 `samples`、负 seed、空结构及无有效目标位点都会显式失败，不会返回伪成功结果。"
msgstr ""
"Unknown elements, negative or nonfinite weights, invalid modes, "
"nonpositive `samples`, negative seeds, empty structures, and the absence "
"of valid target sites all fail explicitly rather than returning a falsely"
" successful result."

